  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Systems Connect: NHS England</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme facilitates collaboration between UK national health organisations and health policy experts and their counterparts in partner countries across the ODA eligible network.  It complements other health investments and influencing efforts in partner countries by providing UK expertise to help tackle health system bottlenecks and to facilitate global learning and effective partnerships. The programme implementing partner (Gov ALB) provides a coordination function and single point of access to match technical expertise from the UK health sector with collaboration requests from partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
